## Command

```shell
biome format --verbose package-lock.json pnpm-lock.yaml packages/app/pnpm-lock.yaml
```

## `package-lock.json`

```json
{ "name": "test" }
```

## `packages/app/pnpm-lock.yaml`

```yaml
lockfileVersion:    '9.0'

```

## `pnpm-lock.yaml`

```yaml
lockfileVersion:    '9.0'

```

